                        -----
                        Introduction
                        -----

Apache RAT Core Tests

 This submodule collects all tests from the Core modules file tree and stores it as a JAR to unify UI-specific testing of RAT client capabilities.

 * will be used in all different UIs and is used as a compatibility layer if you want to build a new UI

 * will make sure that all UIs support the full functionality of RAT

 * is for packaging only! All relevant source code is maintained in RAT core.
